per is the canonical work for modern cryptocurrencies.\n    Laying out an elegant and simple design for Internet-native money, it also\n    paved the way for a more global architecture supporting Bitcoin:\n    blockchain.\">Published in October 2008 on the cryptography mailing list, the\n    Bitcoin Whitepaper is the canonical work for modern cryptocurrencies.\n    Laying out an elegant and simple design for Internet-native money, it also\n    paved the way for a more global architecture supporting Bitcoin:\n    blockchain.</p>\n    <p data-markup-armed=\"1\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-markup-was=\"This edition is adapted for the Ledger Flex. Diagrams have been redrawn\n    to fit the screen sizes and tweaked for readability. Equations and code\n    have been reformatted for the same reason.\">This edition is adapted for the Ledger Flex. Diagrams have been redrawn\n    to fit the screen sizes and tweaked for readability. Equations and code\n    have been reformatted for the same reason.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"acts\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"PRESS.go(''dlstart'')\" data-markup-armed=\"1\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-markup-was=\"Download book\">Download book</button>\n      <span class=\"tally\" data-count=\"bitcoin\">On 1 device</span>\n    </div>\n    </div>","visible":["div.rail:nth-of-type(1) > div.rail-stick > div.device > div.screen","div#step > div.step","div#step > div.step > h1.tall \"Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash \""]}},"bitcoin|2":{"type":"f","viewport":{"w":2560,"h":1305},"theme":"dark","ts":"2026-08-07T12:41:18.778Z","attached":[],"state":{"html":"<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"\">\n    <a class=\"backlink\" href=\"collection.html\" data-markup-armed=\"1\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-markup-was=\"← All books\">← All books</a>\n    <h1 class=\"tall\" data-markup-armed=\"1\" spellcheck=\"true\" data-markup-was=\"Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System\">Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System</h1>\n    <p class=\"byline